      "subtopic": "incarcerated_constituent_visits_and_release",
      "stance": "support",
      "short_exact_quote": "In partnership with local community organizations, we’ve facilitated visits to people incarcerated",
      "locator": "question 15 answer",
      "representation_kind": "policy_position",
      "notes": "Candidate answer to: 15. Do you commit to visit constituents who are incarcerated? Will you work to secure the release of individuals who have demonstrated sincere remorse, worked toward rehabilitation and are not deemed a threat to society? Full answer retained in source body; the short anchor is interpreted only in that context.",
      "attribution_notes": "Quote is from the candidate answer following question 15 answer in the body-verified US Congress NY-07 questionnaire.",
      "claim_summary": "Julie Won supports engagement with incarcerated constituents and review or release for people demonstrating rehabilitation."
    },
